B.J0=new A.eV("prayer","The prayer","Prayer is at set times. In the mosque, follow the imam. People are usually taught these fard units: Fajr 2, Dhuhr 4, Asr 4, Maghrib 3, Isha 4. That count is the common teaching. It is not this verse. Extra sunnah units differ. Follow this mosque.",null,B.a0d,null)
